-    *   Edge 1-2 (Right): Crossed if $(v_1 \ge L \text{ and } v_2 < L)$ or $(v_1 < L \text{ and } v_2 \ge L)$ [S3, S4, unofficial].
-    *   Edge 2-3 (Top): Crossed if $(v_2 \ge L \text{ and } v_3 < L)$ or $(v_2 < L \text{ and } v_3 \ge L)$ [S3, S4, unofficial].
-    *   Edge 3-0 (Left): Crossed if $(v_3 \ge L \text{ and } v_0 < L)$ or $(v_3 < L \text{ and } v_0 \ge L)$ [S3, S4, unofficial].
